_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T08:40:09-08:00","id":348358,"title":"","content":"You know, one of my favorite things about Exalted is the way that greatness from so many other corners of fiction can come and be awesome together, without it feeling like a cluttered kludge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron-crowns.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron...dianportal.com</a> Visit Golden Shackles, Iron Crowns; a 3rd Edition Exalted Campaign ongoing since 2014","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2711-janissary87","name":"Janissary87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2711_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T08:51:07-08:00","id":348361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/348090-ex3-alternative-abyssal-patrons?p=348351#post348351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What comic do I need to read to see Jack Hawksmoor chatting with Gotham and Metropolis?</div> </div> </div> </div>I forget the exact issue but (New52) Stormwatch: Volume 1 the Dark Side.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T09:15:48-08:00","id":348369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/348090-ex3-alternative-abyssal-patrons?p=348327#post348327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Same. I'm find with Deathlords being the default, but independent &quot;ronin&quot; Abyssals being such more supported as a baseline.<br /> <br /> As in, not all independent Abyssals have run from their Deathlord master; some slipped the leash and may be presumed MIA while other Exaltations were never bound to a Monstrance to begin with.</div> </div> </div> </div>At no point am I going to advocate anything with regards to the canon Deathlords in this thread because I already talked until I was blue in the face about their problematic Ex2 canon in my last thread. Suffice it to say for the purposes of this topic that I'm assuming that the canonical Deathlords will still be around in Ex3 and they will still have deathknights but that some new setting element will be adopted that will easily justify abyssal &quot;ronin&quot; as Zelbinnean puts it and these characters will safely be able to pledge themselves to entities which are not the Deathlords without fear of immediate termination or suffering eternal.<br /> <br /> That said, I've always loved the Dual Monarchs and the Council (especially the Orphan) and I'd love to see them on more equal footing with the forces of Oblivion the next time around so we could do a Stygia game about abyssal politicking and bureaucratic corruption. Like a real grimy cop noir drama. What about Creation-based powers? Would anyone else want to work for the Night Mother of Ang Tang?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1318-kindledradial","name":"kindledRadial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1318_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T09:21:23-08:00","id":348374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/348090-ex3-alternative-abyssal-patrons?p=348361#post348361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I forget the exact issue but (New52) Stormwatch: Volume 1 the Dark Side.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even better was him talking to the avatars of Hiroshima and Nagasaki, the reborn nursemaids of dying cities!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"